Implemented ABI v1, normal priority, four native job slots, and baseline one-job admission/terminal WriteBatches. No ABI v2 implementation, group commit, external dependency, Bitcoin library, kernel replacement, or service test hook. No predecessor handoff was supplied. This submission has not received evaluator feedback.

